      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, quick question. i have a really bad sinus infection like my head is literally pounding. i'm on lisinopril for my blood pressure (the doc said i have stage 2 hypertension so it's a bit high), but is it okay if i take some sudafed to help with the congestion? i just really need to breathe right now.",
